WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.000 --> 01:55.720
=Episode 12=

22
02:05.624 --> 02:06.384
Why are you here?

23
02:09.585 --> 02:09.985
Mom.

24
02:11.265 --> 02:11.744
Aren't you

25
02:11.784 --> 02:12.664
in the UK right now?

26
02:13.664 --> 02:14.464
Why are you here?

27
02:17.425 --> 02:18.344
Fang Haoyu, stop!

28
02:18.664 --> 02:19.425
If you don't,

29
02:19.585 --> 02:20.585
I'll freeze your cards.

30
02:28.224 --> 02:29.105
I'm sorry, Mom.

31
02:29.105 --> 02:30.305
I didn't mean to lie to you.

32
02:30.784 --> 02:31.664
I came back

33
02:31.705 --> 02:32.305
for school.

34
02:33.105 --> 02:33.504
Really.

35
02:34.744 --> 02:35.504
Please forgive me.

36
02:35.744 --> 02:36.784
Won't happen again.

37
02:36.784 --> 02:38.184
When did you return?

38
02:38.585 --> 02:39.865
Just a couple of days ago.

39
02:40.224 --> 02:40.784
I wanted

40
02:40.784 --> 02:41.344
to sneak back

41
02:41.425 --> 02:42.784
just to surprise you guys.

42
02:44.425 --> 02:45.504
One more chance.

43
02:45.825 --> 02:46.305
Again.

44
02:47.105 --> 02:47.865
Earlier this month.

45
02:47.865 --> 02:48.464
On the fifth.

46
02:49.865 --> 02:50.585
How did you know?

47
02:51.265 --> 02:52.904
I know your every move,

48
02:53.904 --> 02:54.825
so don't lie to me.

49
02:54.904 --> 02:55.585
Impossible.

50
02:56.385 --> 02:57.145
I haven't

51
02:57.184 --> 02:58.184
used any of your cards.

52
02:58.504 --> 02:59.585
When you have classes,

53
03:00.145 --> 03:01.664
your daily WeChat steps hit 13,000.

54
03:01.944 --> 03:02.585
When you don't,

55
03:02.624 --> 03:03.385
it's barely 4,000.

56
03:03.825 --> 03:04.744
At home,

57
03:05.464 --> 03:06.105
after midnight,

58
03:06.145 --> 03:07.224
I check your step count.

59
03:07.545 --> 03:08.664
When you started moving,

60
03:08.784 --> 03:09.585
I was relieved.

61
03:09.825 --> 03:10.904
But starting on the fifth,

62
03:11.784 --> 03:12.425
past midnight,

63
03:12.585 --> 03:13.265
your step count

64
03:13.265 --> 03:14.385
dropped noticeably.

65
03:15.145 --> 03:16.705
You barely walked in days.

66
03:18.224 --> 03:19.528
Where are you staying?

67
03:20.025 --> 03:20.744
Pack your things

68
03:20.744 --> 03:21.344
right away,

69
03:21.464 --> 03:22.385
and head to my place.

70
03:22.385 --> 03:22.904
Don't worry.

71
03:22.944 --> 03:24.545
I'm staying at a friend's cafe.

72
03:24.664 --> 03:25.744
Give me their phone number.

73
03:30.224 --> 03:30.784
It's so late.

74
03:30.865 --> 03:31.705
Why are you here?

75
03:32.985 --> 03:33.265
Me?

76
03:33.664 --> 03:35.025
I work here.

77
03:35.904 --> 03:36.825
This is my workplace.

78
03:38.385 --> 03:39.025
What about you?

79
03:40.744 --> 03:41.025
Well,

80
03:41.624 --> 03:42.825
what are you doing here?

81
03:43.105 --> 03:43.545
I...

82
03:43.624 --> 03:44.385
Ms. Hui.

83
03:47.859 --> 03:49.238
(Hospital Transfer Notice)

84
03:49.344 --> 03:50.224
Are you sure?

85
03:51.184 --> 03:52.865
Given the patient's current condition,

86
03:53.265 --> 03:53.784
a transfer

87
03:53.985 --> 03:55.545
might not offer better outcomes.

88
03:57.025 --> 03:57.865
I want to try.

89
03:58.385 --> 03:59.545
The hospital in Shanghai

90
03:59.705 --> 04:00.744
specializes in heart

91
04:00.744 --> 04:01.464
and brain issues.

92
04:01.825 --> 04:03.585
Even with Parkinson's,

93
04:03.784 --> 04:05.025
my dad was super resilient.

94
04:06.064 --> 04:07.705
Right now, if he remains in a coma

95
04:08.224 --> 04:08.944
like this...

96
04:09.145 --> 04:11.112
The Beijing specialist suggested this?

97
04:12.464 --> 04:13.585
What Beijing specialist?

98
04:20.784 --> 04:21.145
Mom.

99
04:22.104 --> 04:22.825
I invited

100
04:22.825 --> 04:23.864
Dr. Du,

101
04:23.864 --> 04:25.505
a neurovascular specialist from Beijing.

102
04:28.025 --> 04:29.705
Dad's condition is unstable right now.

103
04:29.864 --> 04:31.025
Transferring him is risky.

104
04:31.705 --> 04:32.864
So I had the doctor come

105
04:32.864 --> 04:33.904
from Beijing.

106
04:34.904 --> 04:35.745
Thank you so much.

107
04:36.625 --> 04:37.145
Not at all.

108
04:42.784 --> 04:43.185
Mr. Di,

109
04:43.745 --> 04:44.505
a word in private?

110
04:46.625 --> 04:47.265
Be right back.

111
04:54.664 --> 04:55.904
Mr. Di, here's the thing.

112
05:00.344 --> 05:01.224
This is my wife,

113
05:01.664 --> 05:02.696
the patient's daughter.

114
05:03.664 --> 05:04.104
Hello.

115
05:04.505 --> 05:06.544
You must be the specialist from Beijing.

116
05:07.065 --> 05:07.424
Hello.

117
05:08.825 --> 05:09.385
Dr. Du,

118
05:10.385 --> 05:11.265
let's get it straight.

119
05:12.385 --> 05:13.945
We can handle it.

120
05:14.145 --> 05:15.505
The patient is not looking good.

121
05:15.505 --> 05:16.705
The cerebral bleed triggered

122
05:16.705 --> 05:17.705
a massive stroke,

123
05:17.705 --> 05:18.664
leaving permanent

124
05:18.664 --> 05:19.424
nerve damage.

125
05:19.864 --> 05:21.065
Especially, brainstem function

126
05:21.065 --> 05:21.745
is badly damaged.

127
05:22.745 --> 05:24.224
Despite intracranial pressure control

128
05:24.304 --> 05:26.025
and neuroprotective therapy,

129
05:26.104 --> 05:28.065
the test results show

130
05:28.265 --> 05:29.344
he won't come around soon.

131
05:30.745 --> 05:31.825
Legally speaking,

132
05:32.385 --> 05:33.265
can he be

133
05:33.464 --> 05:34.904
deemed incapacitated?

134
05:36.185 --> 05:36.904
Exactly.

135
05:43.065 --> 05:43.585
Mom,

136
05:44.224 --> 05:44.864
are you hurt?

137
05:46.304 --> 05:48.224
Face obstacles head-on. Don't escape.

138
05:48.385 --> 05:50.344
If you're predicted to get in a car crash,

139
05:50.625 --> 05:51.904
go to an amusement park

140
05:52.065 --> 05:53.625
and crash bumper cars.

141
05:54.185 --> 05:55.945
If predicted to have surgery and scars,

142
05:56.344 --> 05:58.304
get double eyelid surgery in advance.

143
05:58.945 --> 06:00.505
Fate is flexible.

144
06:00.664 --> 06:01.344
Just fell asleep.

145
06:02.745 --> 06:03.464
The rest is

146
06:03.945 --> 06:05.585
for you to explore on your own.

147
06:11.625 --> 06:12.065
By the way,

148
06:12.904 --> 06:13.424
Ms. Hui?

149
06:13.984 --> 06:14.664
She's not here?

150
06:16.505 --> 06:18.025
She called in sick.

151
06:18.344 --> 06:19.385
I'll call her later to see

152
06:19.585 --> 06:20.424
if she's better

153
06:20.705 --> 06:21.745
and can come back to help.

154
06:24.705 --> 06:26.344
She and Duan have been taking turns

155
06:26.984 --> 06:28.065
caring for my parents.

156
06:28.104 --> 06:28.664
Quite tiring.

157
06:29.784 --> 06:30.185
Well,

158
06:30.625 --> 06:32.145
have her bring the medical bills.

159
06:32.145 --> 06:33.320
I'll reimburse her.

160
06:34.945 --> 06:35.904
You know Ms. Hui.

161
06:36.505 --> 06:37.544
She never fusses

162
06:37.745 --> 06:38.784
over small illnesses,

163
06:38.904 --> 06:39.945
so she won't see a doctor.

164
06:42.904 --> 06:43.945
If there's nothing else,

165
06:43.945 --> 06:44.664
I should go.

166
06:45.825 --> 06:47.625
The shareholder meeting prep is tedious.

167
06:47.625 --> 06:48.385
So much to do.

168
06:48.945 --> 06:49.505
I have to go.

169
06:50.224 --> 06:50.625
Go ahead.

170
07:05.406 --> 07:06.376
(I've drafted the meeting agenda. Can you review?)

171
07:06.376 --> 07:07.256
(Venue's set. Admin, confirm headcount ASAP.)

172
07:07.256 --> 07:08.344
(Wrap this process fast. Payments are stuck. They bug me.)

173
07:08.344 --> 07:09.265
Di Liren

174
07:09.265 --> 07:10.625
has no overseas accounts or assets

175
07:10.625 --> 07:11.544
under his name.

176
07:11.825 --> 07:12.304
So,

177
07:12.464 --> 07:13.825
he needs someone he trusts

178
07:13.825 --> 07:14.544
to hold them.

179
07:14.864 --> 07:16.304
That person is clearly Lu Hui.

180
07:16.625 --> 07:18.065
He needs her money,

181
07:18.185 --> 07:19.625
and she still has feelings for him.

182
07:19.705 --> 07:20.385
So the two

183
07:20.424 --> 07:21.512
restrain each other.

184
07:21.825 --> 07:22.344
However,

185
07:22.705 --> 07:23.745
it's odd Lu Hui suddenly

186
07:23.745 --> 07:24.265
took leave.

187
07:24.585 --> 07:25.104
I guess

188
07:25.464 --> 07:26.544
they're onto something new.

189
07:27.185 --> 07:27.945
What matters now is

190
07:28.104 --> 07:29.065
the shareholder meeting.

191
07:29.344 --> 07:30.304
If signing authority

192
07:30.385 --> 07:31.385
falls to Di Liren,

193
07:31.464 --> 07:32.385
he'll take Jiali

194
07:32.505 --> 07:33.224
for himself.

195
07:33.304 --> 07:34.265
Can we rally up

196
07:34.304 --> 07:35.464
the small shareholders?

197
07:35.464 --> 07:36.505
Their shares are small,

198
07:36.864 --> 07:37.464
but add them up

199
07:37.544 --> 07:38.304
and they matter.

200
07:38.825 --> 07:40.464
My dad holds 45 percent,

201
07:40.705 --> 07:42.025
and Mr. Tian holds 35 percent.

202
07:42.344 --> 07:43.945
Even if we win over the rest,

203
07:44.344 --> 07:45.025
it won't help.

204
07:46.104 --> 07:47.544
I could forge a power of attorney,

205
07:47.544 --> 07:49.185
saying Mr. Yu signed it before going

206
07:49.185 --> 07:49.705
into a coma,

207
07:49.864 --> 07:51.745
but the lawyer didn't notarize it yet.

208
07:52.265 --> 07:53.505
No one knows the truth anyway.

209
07:53.585 --> 07:53.864
Right?

210
07:54.464 --> 07:55.424
Don't be silly.

211
07:55.864 --> 07:56.664
Do you want

212
07:56.705 --> 07:57.385
to earn yourself

213
07:57.464 --> 07:58.385
a limited-edition pair

214
07:58.464 --> 07:59.544
of handcuffs?

215
08:00.464 --> 08:00.945
Come on.

216
08:01.025 --> 08:02.265
You're so bold.

217
08:02.385 --> 08:03.544
That's illegal.

218
08:04.304 --> 08:05.505
Mr. Tian is our only option.

219
08:05.984 --> 08:06.945
You must convince him.

220
08:14.864 --> 08:15.904
When did you get back?

221
08:16.585 --> 08:17.505
Just now.

222
08:21.304 --> 08:22.864
Why are you speaking English?

223
08:22.864 --> 08:23.864
We're leaving soon.

224
08:23.904 --> 08:24.984
I have to practice.

225
08:25.424 --> 08:26.224
By the way,

226
08:26.224 --> 08:26.945
I wanna

227
08:26.984 --> 08:28.065
ship some things to the UK.

228
08:28.344 --> 08:29.304
Do you need anything?

229
08:29.825 --> 08:30.864
Haoyu told me

230
08:31.224 --> 08:32.745
that there are Chinese supermarkets,

231
08:33.225 --> 08:34.385
but certain ingredients

232
08:34.784 --> 08:35.544
are hard to find

233
08:35.784 --> 08:36.304
and limited.

234
08:37.985 --> 08:38.505
I'll pass.

235
08:38.696 --> 08:40.025
Signing authority

236
08:40.025 --> 08:40.944
will be mine soon.

237
08:41.424 --> 08:43.064
The sooner, the more careful.

238
08:44.145 --> 08:45.505
Yu Meng is watching me closely.

239
08:45.865 --> 08:46.704
She just asked me

240
08:46.944 --> 08:48.025
what illness you had.

241
08:48.465 --> 08:48.824
Okay.

242
08:49.304 --> 08:49.944
To be safe,

243
08:50.784 --> 08:51.544
don't go home yet.

244
08:51.544 --> 08:52.505
I told Haoyu you are

245
08:52.505 --> 08:53.736
on a business trip.

246
08:58.544 --> 08:59.704
You're always so thoughtful.

247
09:00.745 --> 09:02.225
What did Yu Jianguo's lawyer say?

248
09:03.625 --> 09:05.025
He made it clear.

249
09:05.465 --> 09:06.584
Per company bylaws,

250
09:07.145 --> 09:08.544
it has to go to

251
09:08.544 --> 09:09.304
a shareholder vote.

252
09:09.865 --> 09:11.064
Once I get signing authority

253
09:11.064 --> 09:12.064
and wipe the traces

254
09:12.064 --> 09:13.265
that incriminate us,

255
09:13.664 --> 09:14.424
we'll never have to

256
09:14.505 --> 09:15.145
fear them all.

257
09:17.745 --> 09:18.385
Meng,

258
09:18.664 --> 09:19.625
Mr. Tian's schedule

259
09:19.664 --> 09:20.584
is fully packed lately.

260
09:20.745 --> 09:21.784
He really cannot

261
09:21.824 --> 09:22.944
spare the time to see you.

262
09:23.105 --> 09:24.424
That's coming directly from him.

263
09:26.759 --> 09:28.479
(- Mr. Tian, are you free today? - Busy. Going on a business trip.)

264
09:28.479 --> 09:30.019
(- Can we schedule a time today? - I have plans.)

265
09:33.584 --> 09:35.105
Why is Mr. Tian dodging you?

266
09:38.304 --> 09:39.465
Because of Di Liren, I bet.

267
09:41.944 --> 09:42.784
You're half right.

268
09:43.385 --> 09:44.184
Let me guess.

269
09:44.544 --> 09:45.584
Mr. Tian avoids you

270
09:45.865 --> 09:46.584
for your own good.

271
09:47.064 --> 09:47.944
How did you know?

272
09:48.225 --> 09:49.265
Fortune-tellers read fate,

273
09:49.584 --> 09:50.904
and lawyers read minds.

274
09:54.345 --> 09:56.105
I cornered Mr. Tian

275
09:56.184 --> 09:56.985
at his doorstep,

276
09:57.424 --> 09:58.784
and he finally told me the truth.

277
09:59.184 --> 10:00.345
Di Liren went to see him

278
10:00.465 --> 10:01.465
and told him,

279
10:01.625 --> 10:03.345
before the shareholders' meeting,

280
10:03.345 --> 10:04.265
not to go to Jiali

281
10:04.265 --> 10:04.985
or the hospital,

282
10:05.064 --> 10:05.865
and not to see Liren

283
10:05.865 --> 10:06.625
or me.

284
10:06.944 --> 10:07.505
Why?

285
10:08.105 --> 10:09.345
Because Di Liren said

286
10:09.664 --> 10:11.824
whether his vote goes to him or me,

287
10:12.064 --> 10:12.904
he doesn't mind

288
10:13.064 --> 10:14.265
since we're husband and wife.

289
10:15.025 --> 10:15.625
However,

290
10:15.704 --> 10:16.584
if someone

291
10:16.625 --> 10:17.465
uses it against him,

292
10:17.584 --> 10:18.704
they'll say

293
10:18.904 --> 10:19.745
Mr. Tian turned Jiali

294
10:19.824 --> 10:21.105
into a mom-and-pop shop

295
10:21.225 --> 10:22.784
due to his close ties with our family.

296
10:22.904 --> 10:23.865
That'll stir up trouble,

297
10:23.944 --> 10:24.944
so he stays out of it.

298
10:24.944 --> 10:26.064
What nonsense!

299
10:26.145 --> 10:26.865
How shameless.

300
10:26.865 --> 10:28.544
His shamelessness

301
10:28.544 --> 10:30.225
completely shocked me.

302
10:30.904 --> 10:31.985
Still, I feel he is

303
10:32.745 --> 10:33.544
getting desperate.

304
10:34.265 --> 10:35.505
You mean

305
10:35.664 --> 10:37.145
we should do the exact opposite?

306
10:37.985 --> 10:38.385
Exactly.

307
10:38.904 --> 10:39.745
You should

308
10:39.824 --> 10:41.385
conspicuously visit Mr. Tian right now.

309
10:41.745 --> 10:42.865
We will talk

310
10:42.944 --> 10:43.904
about signing authority

311
10:43.904 --> 10:44.904
after we see him.

312
10:45.304 --> 10:47.145
Right now, you must make everyone believe

313
10:47.704 --> 10:49.064
that even if Di Liren takes over,

314
10:49.225 --> 10:50.025
it's only

315
10:50.025 --> 10:50.784
thanks to you

316
10:50.904 --> 10:52.584
and your family's backing.

317
10:53.105 --> 10:53.904
You were right.

318
10:54.145 --> 10:55.505
Fortune-tellers read fate,

319
10:55.505 --> 10:56.465
and lawyers read minds.

320
10:57.345 --> 10:58.025
Be low-key.

321
11:00.465 --> 11:01.584
That's all

322
11:01.625 --> 11:02.345
for today's shoot.

323
11:02.345 --> 11:02.865
Let's go.

324
11:02.985 --> 11:03.225
Okay.

325
11:04.944 --> 11:05.424
Sorry,

326
11:05.544 --> 11:06.505
it's my lunch hour.

327
11:06.784 --> 11:08.184
I need to eat before we go.

328
11:08.584 --> 11:09.625
Grab a bite downstairs?

329
11:09.704 --> 11:10.025
Sure.

330
11:10.184 --> 11:10.704
No way.

331
11:10.784 --> 11:11.465
Harry and Meng

332
11:11.505 --> 11:12.345
are on their way.

333
11:12.345 --> 11:13.625
There's no time to eat out now.

334
11:14.465 --> 11:14.784
Well...

335
11:16.745 --> 11:17.865
I didn't bring lunch either,

336
11:18.304 --> 11:19.625
but there are some rice balls

337
11:19.625 --> 11:20.304
and cookies here.

338
11:20.385 --> 11:20.944
You eat them.

339
11:21.265 --> 11:22.024
You made them?

340
11:22.544 --> 11:22.944
Yes.

341
11:23.265 --> 11:24.465
Positive reviews only.

342
11:35.064 --> 11:35.904
Sticky rice.

343
11:37.225 --> 11:37.865
Soggy seaweed.

344
11:38.544 --> 11:40.184
The shape isn't bad, though.

345
11:40.704 --> 11:41.745
I'd rate it a six, max.

346
11:42.424 --> 11:43.385
Do you know how to cook?

347
11:43.625 --> 11:43.985
Nope.

348
11:44.424 --> 11:45.544
Who asked you to rate it?

349
11:45.944 --> 11:47.184
I don't need to be a mechanic

350
11:47.304 --> 11:48.025
to tell

351
11:48.544 --> 11:49.865
if a car is good, right?

352
11:51.064 --> 11:51.625
Give it back.

353
11:51.865 --> 11:52.544
No.

354
11:55.184 --> 11:55.904
I took a bite.

355
11:55.904 --> 11:56.465
It's all mine.

356
12:02.625 --> 12:03.184
Let's go.

357
12:04.544 --> 12:05.184
Wait, hold on.

358
12:05.345 --> 12:06.145
Hold on.

359
12:07.424 --> 12:08.424
If only we could work

360
12:08.505 --> 12:09.505
in such a gorgeous place

361
12:09.584 --> 12:10.184
every time.

362
12:10.625 --> 12:12.304
Sure, and Liu Zi even

363
12:12.304 --> 12:13.544
arranged to shoot on a boat.

364
12:13.625 --> 12:14.345
The results will

365
12:14.424 --> 12:14.944
look great.

366
12:20.745 --> 12:21.480
You drink it.

367
12:22.184 --> 12:22.505
Thanks.

368
12:27.345 --> 12:28.625
You called right on time.

369
12:29.105 --> 12:30.465
About the signing authority,

370
12:30.505 --> 12:31.225
I need to talk.

371
12:31.465 --> 12:32.265
Leave that aside

372
12:32.345 --> 12:33.064
for a second.

373
12:33.184 --> 12:34.584
Remember Huang said the last time

374
12:34.664 --> 12:35.944
he saw Lu Hui and Fang Yong,

375
12:35.944 --> 12:37.385
Lu Hui was already pregnant?

376
12:39.704 --> 12:40.345
Hold on.

377
12:42.704 --> 12:43.184
Harry,

378
12:43.505 --> 12:44.345
help me find it.

379
12:44.584 --> 12:44.944
Sure.

380
12:45.584 --> 12:46.265
Over there.

381
12:48.225 --> 12:48.584
Go on.

382
12:49.105 --> 12:50.345
I tracked down a nurse

383
12:50.345 --> 12:51.505
who worked with Lu Hui,

384
12:51.544 --> 12:52.265
and she confirmed

385
12:52.424 --> 12:53.265
Lu Hui and Fang Yong

386
12:53.265 --> 12:54.225
indeed had a child.

387
12:54.345 --> 12:55.064
A boy.

388
12:55.304 --> 12:55.784
The boy

389
12:55.865 --> 12:56.824
was born sick.

390
12:56.904 --> 12:57.824
Tetralogy of Fallot.

391
12:57.904 --> 12:58.824
It's a very complex,

392
12:58.904 --> 12:59.544
costly

393
12:59.664 --> 13:00.704
congenital heart disease.

394
13:01.140 --> 13:02.095
Lu Hui borrowed money,

395
13:02.095 --> 13:02.944
but couldn't cure him.

396
13:02.944 --> 13:04.105
She left with her son

397
13:04.625 --> 13:05.184
and then

398
13:05.664 --> 13:06.704
lost all contact.

399
13:07.064 --> 13:08.265
Didn't she have a daughter?

400
13:08.944 --> 13:10.184
Lu Hui lied.

401
13:10.824 --> 13:12.225
The daughter was a smokescreen.

402
13:12.544 --> 13:13.625
They only had a son.

403
13:14.385 --> 13:14.904
Found it.

404
13:15.664 --> 13:16.064
That's it.

405
13:16.345 --> 13:17.145
I'll call you back.

406
13:19.304 --> 13:19.584
Here.

407
13:19.985 --> 13:20.544
Thank you.

408
13:26.345 --> 13:26.784
Meng,

409
13:28.025 --> 13:28.784
you're married?

410
13:36.105 --> 13:36.704
You're back.

411
13:37.465 --> 13:38.304
Time to eat.

412
13:42.544 --> 13:42.944
Mom,

413
13:43.177 --> 13:44.385
who told you to wash my socks

414
13:44.385 --> 13:45.064
and underwear?

415
13:45.424 --> 13:46.985
I saw them, so I just washed them.

416
13:47.345 --> 13:48.584
I'm 20 years old!

417
13:48.584 --> 13:49.265
Can you please

418
13:49.265 --> 13:50.225
respect my privacy?

419
13:50.225 --> 13:51.145
I'm a grown man.

420
13:51.985 --> 13:53.345
Sure, but I'm your mom.

421
13:53.944 --> 13:55.184
Why didn't you ask for privacy

422
13:55.584 --> 13:56.664
when you were in my womb?

423
13:56.865 --> 13:57.345
Eat.

424
14:04.304 --> 14:04.958
Where's Dad?

425
14:05.704 --> 14:06.604
On a business trip.

426
14:07.345 --> 14:08.407
He'll be back next month.

427
14:10.184 --> 14:11.105
Where did you go today?

428
14:12.145 --> 14:12.704
To the park.

429
14:14.584 --> 14:15.304
With whom?

430
14:17.345 --> 14:18.105
With the girl

431
14:18.105 --> 14:18.985
I told you about.

432
14:19.025 --> 14:20.099
I met her in the cafe.

433
14:21.904 --> 14:23.025
The pretty one, right?

434
14:27.225 --> 14:28.025
She's really nice,

435
14:28.465 --> 14:29.265
works hard,

436
14:30.265 --> 14:31.150
and treats me well.

437
14:31.745 --> 14:32.784
What does she do?

438
14:33.704 --> 14:34.704
I think she shoots videos

439
14:34.784 --> 14:35.664
for her company.

440
14:35.985 --> 14:36.625
I don't know

441
14:36.625 --> 14:37.225
the specifics.

442
14:40.304 --> 14:41.064
Can I take a look

443
14:41.105 --> 14:41.944
at her Moments?

444
14:43.265 --> 14:44.625
It's set to three days only.

445
14:44.745 --> 14:45.424
Nothing to see.

446
14:53.166 --> 14:55.346
(South Lake Scenic Area Boat Ticket)

447
14:58.704 --> 14:59.664
You went on a date?

448
15:01.465 --> 15:02.025
No.

449
15:03.544 --> 15:04.388
It was for work.

450
15:04.824 --> 15:05.505
With others too.

451
15:07.625 --> 15:08.265
Besides,

452
15:09.265 --> 15:10.424
she's already married.

453
15:12.025 --> 15:12.865
Then you're out.

454
15:13.304 --> 15:15.064
I told you. I don't have a thing for her.

455
15:15.465 --> 15:16.784
I just think she's a great girl.

456
15:24.459 --> 15:25.955
(Meng)

457
15:52.865 --> 15:53.865
How much older is she?

458
15:54.025 --> 15:55.082
I'm not messaging her.

459
15:55.145 --> 15:56.424
I didn't say you are.

460
15:57.025 --> 15:57.944
Telling on yourself?

461
15:59.145 --> 15:59.625
Meng,

462
16:00.584 --> 16:01.944
how does my calligraphy look?

463
16:02.025 --> 16:02.505
Is it good?

464
16:02.904 --> 16:03.265
Sure.

465
16:03.664 --> 16:04.064
Mom,

466
16:05.304 --> 16:06.345
what got you into it?

467
16:06.465 --> 16:08.178
I'm copying the Medicine Buddha Sutra.

468
16:08.304 --> 16:09.505
Master Xiuyuan said

469
16:09.784 --> 16:11.145
sincerity brings blessings.

470
16:12.225 --> 16:12.784
Mom...

471
16:13.584 --> 16:15.424
If Mom enjoys it, let her be.

472
16:15.664 --> 16:16.944
As long as it makes her happy.

473
16:17.584 --> 16:18.064
Mom,

474
16:18.784 --> 16:20.265
it looks great. Keep going.

475
16:27.745 --> 16:28.265
Honey,

476
16:28.865 --> 16:29.505
I have good news

477
16:29.584 --> 16:30.345
for you.

478
16:31.985 --> 16:33.025
I'm not listening.

479
16:33.784 --> 16:34.784
You have

480
16:34.944 --> 16:35.985
totally lost my trust.

481
16:36.265 --> 16:36.865
I don't believe

482
16:36.944 --> 16:37.904
you have any good news.

483
16:40.145 --> 16:40.824
Well,

484
16:41.064 --> 16:41.944
I reached out

485
16:41.944 --> 16:43.304
to a famous video production team.

486
16:44.145 --> 16:45.424
I'll let them do the promotion

487
16:45.424 --> 16:46.664
for Kanglong Lab.

488
16:47.105 --> 16:48.424
So much has happened lately.

489
16:48.784 --> 16:49.385
Honestly,

490
16:49.664 --> 16:50.424
I know

491
16:50.745 --> 16:51.745
you're worried about Dad.

492
16:52.385 --> 16:53.664
Mom needs you too.

493
16:54.184 --> 16:55.145
So as for work,

494
16:55.385 --> 16:56.385
just leave it to me.

495
16:59.944 --> 17:00.584
My goodness.

496
17:01.105 --> 17:02.385
That's way too on point!

497
17:03.625 --> 17:04.505
What is it?

498
17:04.624 --> 17:05.584
A new vlogger

499
17:05.705 --> 17:06.985
at Zi's firm insisted on

500
17:07.225 --> 17:08.425
reading my fortune.

501
17:08.985 --> 17:10.864
He said someone would try

502
17:10.985 --> 17:11.945
to sabotage me

503
17:11.985 --> 17:12.665
at work.

504
17:13.344 --> 17:14.544
I didn't buy it back then.

505
17:15.225 --> 17:16.584
The boss is my husband.

506
17:16.745 --> 17:17.505
Why would you

507
17:17.544 --> 17:18.225
sabotage me?

508
17:18.864 --> 17:19.665
But now?

509
17:20.544 --> 17:21.344
Are you going

510
17:21.384 --> 17:22.304
to sabotage me, honey?

511
17:26.384 --> 17:27.824
That guy

512
17:27.905 --> 17:28.665
is so thoughtless.

513
17:29.945 --> 17:30.425
Fine.

514
17:31.465 --> 17:32.265
I'll be thoughtful

515
17:32.584 --> 17:33.864
to my dear wife.

516
17:35.144 --> 17:36.425
He did a reading for you too.

517
17:38.384 --> 17:39.344
Guess what he said?

518
17:40.544 --> 17:41.985
He said you're destined

519
17:42.344 --> 17:43.425
to have a son.

520
17:47.304 --> 17:48.304
Then that means

521
17:48.665 --> 17:49.425
a boy comes first.

522
17:50.144 --> 17:50.784
After that,

523
17:50.945 --> 17:52.185
do you want a boy or a girl?

524
17:53.144 --> 17:54.265
If we have two boys,

525
17:54.425 --> 17:55.745
we'll live a noisy life.

526
17:56.945 --> 17:58.344
But he said

527
17:58.425 --> 17:59.624
you already

528
18:00.025 --> 18:01.304
had a 20-year-old son.

529
18:03.824 --> 18:05.304
I totally doubted it.

530
18:06.505 --> 18:08.905
20 years ago you were only 23,

531
18:09.344 --> 18:10.824
just past the legal marriage age,

532
18:11.344 --> 18:12.505
and had a child back then?

533
18:15.185 --> 18:16.225
Looks like he is

534
18:16.225 --> 18:17.219
a bad fortuneteller,

535
18:17.425 --> 18:18.265
talking nonsense.

536
18:18.624 --> 18:19.344
Exactly.

537
18:19.864 --> 18:21.544
I knew he was talking nonsense.

538
18:22.144 --> 18:22.824
I doubt

539
18:23.104 --> 18:23.824
you can

540
18:23.864 --> 18:25.104
raise a child secretly

541
18:25.624 --> 18:26.784
right under our noses.

542
18:27.384 --> 18:28.824
That's absurd.

543
18:30.465 --> 18:31.225
I get it.

544
18:32.624 --> 18:33.824
If I don't let you work,

545
18:33.864 --> 18:35.784
you'll just pick fights out of boredom.

546
18:36.505 --> 18:36.824
Fine.

547
18:37.864 --> 18:38.824
You're in charge

548
18:38.864 --> 18:40.144
of Kanglong Lab's publicity.

549
18:40.144 --> 18:40.665
Okay?

550
18:43.265 --> 18:43.784
Really?

551
18:45.144 --> 18:46.665
No taking it back, honey.

552
18:47.304 --> 18:48.064
I'll make a call.

553
19:00.784 --> 19:02.104
Meng, come here.

554
19:04.104 --> 19:04.745
Coming, Mom.

555
19:06.144 --> 19:07.185
Hurry up.

556
19:09.705 --> 19:10.584
Come take a look.

557
19:14.745 --> 19:15.344
Look.

558
19:15.864 --> 19:17.705
Young people are stubborn.

559
19:18.265 --> 19:19.304
A couple of days ago,

560
19:19.344 --> 19:20.665
I shared Master Xiuyuan's video

561
19:21.064 --> 19:22.705
with Mr. Tian's wife.

562
19:23.225 --> 19:24.304
She was very interested

563
19:24.425 --> 19:25.624
and kept asking me

564
19:26.064 --> 19:28.185
if Master Xiuyuan offers offline classes,

565
19:28.465 --> 19:30.465
saying we could go together sometime.

566
19:33.824 --> 19:34.584
Now I finally

567
19:34.624 --> 19:35.265
found the outlet

568
19:35.265 --> 19:36.577
for my mom's drama queen side.

569
19:38.064 --> 19:38.624
I can

570
19:38.624 --> 19:39.905
use her link to Mr. Tian's wife

571
19:39.905 --> 19:41.064
to help persuade Mr. Tian.

572
19:41.905 --> 19:43.144
I'm going back to the office.

573
19:43.905 --> 19:44.344
Bye.

574
20:02.945 --> 20:03.544
Where is Haoyu?

575
20:04.064 --> 20:04.705
At home.

576
20:05.104 --> 20:06.064
We just had dinner.

577
20:07.465 --> 20:08.705
Does he seem off?

578
20:09.185 --> 20:09.985
Not at all.

579
20:10.144 --> 20:10.745
What's wrong?

580
20:11.225 --> 20:11.824
Nothing.

581
20:13.104 --> 20:14.544
Yu Meng was testing me again.

582
20:16.025 --> 20:17.465
It feels like she knows something.

583
20:19.864 --> 20:21.025
Keep a close eye on Haoyu.

584
20:21.584 --> 20:23.064
Don't get him involved into this.

585
20:23.544 --> 20:23.824
Okay.

586
20:24.505 --> 20:25.006
By the way,

587
20:26.144 --> 20:27.158
I have a task for you.

588
20:59.320 --> 21:01.544
(Mom)

589
21:01.544 --> 21:02.384
Hello, Mom.

590
21:02.784 --> 21:04.544
You said you went shopping.

591
21:05.104 --> 21:06.864
But the mall is closed now.

592
21:07.544 --> 21:08.745
Why aren't you back yet?

593
21:10.144 --> 21:11.624
I just thought that

594
21:12.185 --> 21:13.025
since Dad got sick,

595
21:13.064 --> 21:14.344
Mr. Tian has

596
21:14.584 --> 21:15.465
been helpful,

597
21:15.945 --> 21:17.584
so I want to fetch a bottle

598
21:17.584 --> 21:18.384
of fine wine

599
21:18.384 --> 21:19.745
and give it to Mr. Tian.

600
21:19.824 --> 21:21.025
Are you at the office?

601
21:21.864 --> 21:22.584
Didn't I tell you

602
21:22.584 --> 21:24.384
not to go to the company?

603
21:24.665 --> 21:26.624
Going there will bring bad luck!

604
21:26.824 --> 21:27.864
You'll be jinxed!

605
21:29.225 --> 21:29.945
Hello? Mom?

606
21:30.025 --> 21:30.864
Come back right now!

607
21:30.864 --> 21:32.425
- The reception here seems terrible. - Why are you so stubborn?

608
21:32.905 --> 21:34.824
I can't hear you. Hello?

609
21:35.265 --> 21:35.864
Hello? Mom?

610
21:36.104 --> 21:36.505
Hello?

611
21:44.377 --> 21:49.092
(Under maintenance routine)

612
21:51.824 --> 21:52.544
Bad luck indeed.

613
23:18.544 --> 23:19.425
Honey?

614
23:21.584 --> 23:22.465
Why are you here?

615
23:23.144 --> 23:23.824
Honey.

616
23:24.905 --> 23:26.544
It's you. You scared me to death.

617
23:27.064 --> 23:28.185
I'm here to grab something.

618
23:28.344 --> 23:29.025
Elevator's out.

619
23:29.225 --> 23:30.270
I had to take the stairs.

620
23:30.505 --> 23:31.064
Me too.

621
23:31.304 --> 23:31.985
I just remembered

622
23:32.104 --> 23:33.824
to return this golf club to Mr. Zhou,

623
23:34.144 --> 23:35.465
and the elevator isn't running.

624
23:38.144 --> 23:38.824
So what do we do?

625
23:39.185 --> 23:39.784
It's fine.

626
23:39.945 --> 23:40.624
Let me do it.

627
23:49.745 --> 23:50.665
Leave it. Let's go.

628
24:02.905 --> 24:03.544
(Okay.)

629
24:08.617 --> 24:09.800
(Under maintenance routine)

630
24:19.584 --> 24:20.064
Mom,

631
24:20.985 --> 24:21.584
what's wrong?

632
24:22.304 --> 24:23.344
I have a fever.

633
24:23.864 --> 24:24.985
I feel terrible.

634
24:26.025 --> 24:26.824
Meng,

635
24:27.745 --> 24:29.425
don't go to the office today.

636
24:29.905 --> 24:31.624
Stay home and take care of me.

637
24:32.185 --> 24:32.945
A fever?

638
24:34.104 --> 24:34.665
Let me feel.

639
24:37.784 --> 24:39.225
My whole body aches.

640
24:39.584 --> 24:40.905
I can't even sit up.

641
24:41.304 --> 24:42.824
I can't eat anything.

642
24:43.465 --> 24:44.505
I'm short of breath.

643
24:44.905 --> 24:45.584
Enough, Mom.

644
24:45.624 --> 24:46.344
Stop faking it.

645
24:46.745 --> 24:48.144
You don't have a fever at all.

646
24:48.745 --> 24:49.505
You just don't

647
24:49.505 --> 24:50.985
want me to go to the office, right?

648
24:51.584 --> 24:53.185
Master Xiuyuan was right,

649
24:53.344 --> 24:54.824
but you just wouldn't listen to me.

650
24:55.265 --> 24:56.505
The wine bottle broke,

651
24:56.864 --> 24:58.225
and Liren hurt his finger.

652
24:58.304 --> 24:58.864
Right?

653
24:59.144 --> 25:00.824
That's an omen of bad luck!

654
25:00.945 --> 25:01.745
Why do you still

655
25:01.824 --> 25:02.985
want to go out now?

656
25:03.824 --> 25:04.824
Actually, Mom,

657
25:05.505 --> 25:06.384
I also asked Xiuyuan

658
25:06.384 --> 25:07.344
for a reading.

659
25:07.665 --> 25:08.505
You listen.

660
25:11.624 --> 25:12.304
The wine bottle

661
25:12.304 --> 25:13.465
broke

662
25:13.544 --> 25:14.705
to remove bad luck.

663
25:15.025 --> 25:16.624
Now the bad omen has gone,

664
25:16.905 --> 25:17.864
and your luck's in.

665
25:18.185 --> 25:18.905
No worries.

666
25:19.304 --> 25:19.665
Told you.

667
25:20.104 --> 25:21.104
Master Xiuyuan said

668
25:21.225 --> 25:22.185
I'm fine.

669
25:24.185 --> 25:25.025
I really have no idea

670
25:25.185 --> 25:26.985
what you've been busy with lately.

671
25:27.465 --> 25:28.025
Back then,

672
25:28.505 --> 25:29.824
your dad gave you two choices:

673
25:30.344 --> 25:31.505
either follow his lead

674
25:31.864 --> 25:32.985
and do business,

675
25:33.185 --> 25:34.025
or live carefree

676
25:34.144 --> 25:35.784
just like me.

677
25:36.064 --> 25:37.705
Back then, you chose my path.

678
25:37.905 --> 25:39.425
You searched for so many years

679
25:39.584 --> 25:40.824
and finally found Liren,

680
25:40.905 --> 25:43.144
a man who treats you like a princess.

681
25:43.384 --> 25:44.505
Why are you putting yourself

682
25:44.584 --> 25:46.104
through all this stress now?

683
25:47.025 --> 25:48.185
You don't get it, Mom.

684
25:48.584 --> 25:49.745
A tough princess gets popular

685
25:50.185 --> 25:50.985
right now.

686
25:51.265 --> 25:52.304
I really don't get it,

687
25:53.225 --> 25:54.104
but I know one thing.

688
25:54.104 --> 25:55.304
Given your dad's condition,

689
25:55.624 --> 25:57.265
I can't lose you.

690
25:57.505 --> 25:59.265
A couple of days ago, Master Xiuyuan said

691
25:59.864 --> 26:01.025
our family

692
26:01.705 --> 26:02.624
would go

693
26:02.824 --> 26:04.265
to a scenic mountain

694
26:04.584 --> 26:05.864
to enjoy the view.

695
26:06.624 --> 26:07.665
I was so happy.

696
26:07.985 --> 26:09.665
I thought your dad's condition

697
26:09.784 --> 26:10.425
was improving,

698
26:10.784 --> 26:12.025
or we wouldn't be in the mood

699
26:12.064 --> 26:12.945
for an outing.

700
26:13.465 --> 26:14.745
But yesterday, the doctor said

701
26:15.905 --> 26:17.505
his condition hasn't...

702
26:18.344 --> 26:20.425
I really don't know

703
26:20.864 --> 26:21.624
if your dad will...

704
26:22.465 --> 26:23.384
All right, Mom.

705
26:23.425 --> 26:24.505
Stop overthinking.

706
26:25.185 --> 26:26.584
Dad is going to be fine.

707
26:27.584 --> 26:27.945
Fine.

708
26:28.624 --> 26:29.824
I'll let my coworkers know

709
26:30.144 --> 26:31.060
I'm not going in.

710
26:32.624 --> 26:33.425
Meng isn't coming.

711
26:33.705 --> 26:34.544
Her mom needs her.

712
26:35.144 --> 26:36.864
Stop chatting and get to work.

713
26:37.384 --> 26:38.745
Dr. Kang, have a seat.

714
26:41.584 --> 26:42.384
Say a few words

715
26:42.624 --> 26:43.624
for a sound check.

716
26:49.344 --> 26:50.390
Are you free tonight?

717
26:51.225 --> 26:51.824
Can we

718
26:52.144 --> 26:53.025
grab a drink together?

719
26:59.465 --> 27:00.584
Is the audio good?

720
27:02.784 --> 27:03.425
All good.

721
27:06.025 --> 27:06.705
Dr. Kang,

722
27:06.784 --> 27:08.344
I think you need a touch-up.

723
27:09.824 --> 27:10.745
I'm a guy.

724
27:10.864 --> 27:11.824
Why do I need makeup?

725
27:12.025 --> 27:12.425
No way.

726
27:12.985 --> 27:13.584
You have to.

727
27:13.665 --> 27:14.985
Meng specifically asked for it.

728
27:15.064 --> 27:15.745
We are

729
27:15.745 --> 27:16.745
shooting promotion videos

730
27:16.824 --> 27:17.465
for Jiali.

731
27:17.544 --> 27:18.824
We have to make you look good.

732
27:19.665 --> 27:20.265
I refuse.

733
27:20.945 --> 27:22.384
I promise it'll look very natural.

734
27:22.384 --> 27:23.584
Just covering your dark circles

735
27:23.584 --> 27:24.784
to freshen you up,

736
27:24.864 --> 27:25.265
okay?

737
27:25.544 --> 27:26.344
I-I don't want to.

738
27:26.745 --> 27:27.344
Shoot now.

739
27:27.945 --> 27:28.951
I'll talk to Yu Meng.

740
27:37.465 --> 27:38.985
Let's take a test shot first.

741
27:39.144 --> 27:39.465
Fine.

742
27:52.104 --> 27:52.465
Look.

743
27:52.985 --> 27:53.705
No-makeup look.

744
27:54.304 --> 27:55.544
Why does this

745
27:55.705 --> 27:56.304
look a bit off?

746
27:56.544 --> 27:57.265
What's wrong?

747
27:57.665 --> 27:58.265
Well...

748
27:58.425 --> 27:59.425
That's you, zero makeup.

749
27:59.905 --> 28:00.665
You need makeup.

750
28:03.945 --> 28:04.344
Sure.

751
28:04.705 --> 28:05.384
Wait, no.

752
28:06.025 --> 28:06.425
Come on.

753
28:06.505 --> 28:07.705
Let go of me.

754
28:08.344 --> 28:09.425
Hold still.

755
28:10.505 --> 28:12.185
Fine, I'll do it!

756
28:12.304 --> 28:12.665
Let go.

757
28:13.584 --> 28:14.425
That's more like it.

758
29:16.985 --> 29:17.824
Let's get started.

759
29:18.745 --> 29:19.025
Okay.

760
29:19.584 --> 29:19.905
Ready.

761
29:20.344 --> 29:22.064
Three, two, one.

762
29:22.505 --> 29:22.864
Action.

763
29:23.265 --> 29:24.544
Hello, everyone. I'm Kang Long.

764
29:28.745 --> 29:29.784
Let's call it a day.

765
29:30.465 --> 29:31.384
Great work, everyone.

766
29:40.505 --> 29:41.104
You haven't

767
29:41.104 --> 29:41.824
replied yet.

768
29:42.665 --> 29:43.505
To what?

769
29:43.784 --> 29:44.817
Are you free tonight?

770
29:45.185 --> 29:46.606
I'd like to buy you dinner

771
29:47.344 --> 29:48.824
and return this.

772
29:51.784 --> 29:52.544
Mom!

773
29:54.025 --> 29:55.624
Chestnut, you're out of school!

774
29:58.544 --> 29:59.064
Mom,

775
29:59.384 --> 30:01.225
isn't that my lunch box?

776
30:02.265 --> 30:02.544
Yes.

777
30:03.144 --> 30:04.304
I lent it to him

778
30:04.344 --> 30:04.945
the other day.

779
30:05.824 --> 30:06.665
Your daughter?

780
30:09.185 --> 30:10.082
You have a child?

781
30:32.705 --> 30:33.505
(Your daughter?)

782
30:34.905 --> 30:35.705
You have a child?

783
31:01.584 --> 31:03.225
Any update on the signing authority?

784
31:03.824 --> 31:05.144
I kept thinking

785
31:05.425 --> 31:06.584
how to convince Mr. Tian

786
31:06.584 --> 31:07.544
to vote for me.

787
31:07.945 --> 31:09.344
I even prepared a whole pitch,

788
31:10.225 --> 31:11.584
but then I realized

789
31:11.705 --> 31:12.505
right now,

790
31:12.745 --> 31:13.864
he would never hand it

791
31:13.864 --> 31:14.465
over to me.

792
31:14.745 --> 31:15.384
So,

793
31:15.824 --> 31:17.624
I think I should convince Mr. Tian

794
31:17.705 --> 31:19.104
to take signing authority himself.

795
31:19.225 --> 31:21.144
Ride the wave and shape the tide.

796
31:22.185 --> 31:23.265
I also did some digging.

797
31:23.584 --> 31:24.425
A few years ago,

798
31:24.460 --> 31:25.025
when Di Liren

799
31:25.025 --> 31:26.304
became chairman,

800
31:26.384 --> 31:27.384
Mr. Tian suggested

801
31:27.544 --> 31:28.945
rediscussing the signing authority.

802
31:29.624 --> 31:30.705
He's not into the idea

803
31:30.824 --> 31:32.064
that my family holds

804
31:32.064 --> 31:32.647
all the power.

805
31:33.064 --> 31:33.665
Maybe he's been

806
31:33.665 --> 31:34.584
thinking this way,

807
31:34.824 --> 31:36.025
just hesitant to say it out.

808
31:36.665 --> 31:37.784
If I can't find a contender

809
31:37.864 --> 31:38.945
to rival my opponent,

810
31:39.705 --> 31:41.144
I'll pick one from the referees.

811
31:42.144 --> 31:43.624
Best of all, he doesn't charge,

812
31:44.144 --> 31:45.104
unlike those scammers

813
31:45.304 --> 31:45.824
constantly

814
31:45.945 --> 31:47.144
demanding money from you.

815
31:47.304 --> 31:47.905
Is that so?

816
31:48.384 --> 31:49.225
How is your dad?

817
31:49.304 --> 31:50.185
I'm quite interested

818
31:50.304 --> 31:51.425
in that, too.

819
31:51.705 --> 31:52.705
He hasn't woken up yet,

820
31:52.705 --> 31:53.705
but the doctor said

821
31:53.784 --> 31:55.144
all his vitals are looking better.

822
31:56.705 --> 31:58.361
No wonder your mom is in a good mood.

823
32:00.824 --> 32:01.425
Mr. Tian,

824
32:02.384 --> 32:05.104
about signing authority,

825
32:05.624 --> 32:06.544
I have a new thought.

826
32:06.985 --> 32:07.384
Oh?

827
32:08.384 --> 32:09.745
You're not promoting yourself?

828
32:11.985 --> 32:12.665
Liren

829
32:12.745 --> 32:13.745
is a great entrepreneur,

830
32:13.985 --> 32:15.344
but maybe not the cornerstone

831
32:15.384 --> 32:16.784
to stabilize the company.

832
32:17.225 --> 32:18.344
The signing authority needs

833
32:18.425 --> 32:19.425
to be given to someone

834
32:19.425 --> 32:20.465
with more experience

835
32:20.505 --> 32:22.064
and higher stature to anchor us.

836
32:22.624 --> 32:23.905
In that regard,

837
32:24.064 --> 32:25.025
I'm not qualified.

838
32:26.344 --> 32:28.985
That sounds ideal,

839
32:30.344 --> 32:31.784
but do you have the right candidate?

840
32:32.544 --> 32:32.905
Yes.

841
32:33.745 --> 32:34.225
Who is it?

842
32:35.185 --> 32:35.584
You.

843
32:41.945 --> 32:42.425
Honey,

844
32:42.824 --> 32:43.745
where did you go today?

845
32:46.025 --> 32:46.824
Nowhere special.

846
32:47.025 --> 32:47.905
I just

847
32:48.025 --> 32:49.265
drove Mom around for a bit.

848
32:51.425 --> 32:52.225
Watching a show?

849
33:00.544 --> 33:00.945
Mom.

850
33:06.905 --> 33:07.425
Honey,

851
33:07.745 --> 33:09.025
you've been so caught up

852
33:09.144 --> 33:10.225
in work lately

853
33:10.905 --> 33:12.144
that you rarely visit Dad.

854
33:12.544 --> 33:13.384
Mom is mad at you.

855
33:16.225 --> 33:17.384
My apologies, Mom.

856
33:19.064 --> 33:20.665
Right after Monday's shareholder meeting

857
33:20.824 --> 33:22.425
and signing authority is settled,

858
33:22.745 --> 33:23.945
I'll definitely make time

859
33:24.025 --> 33:24.945
to visit Dad.

860
33:25.745 --> 33:27.265
I'll find better doctors for him, too.

861
33:28.225 --> 33:28.905
Forget it.

862
33:29.344 --> 33:30.544
You'll just have other things

863
33:30.624 --> 33:31.185
to deal with.

864
33:32.384 --> 33:33.104
I promise.

865
33:33.377 --> 33:34.809
(Zhang Tao)

866
33:38.025 --> 33:38.465
See?

867
33:43.369 --> 33:44.652
(Zhang Tao)

868
33:56.985 --> 33:57.584
Pick it up.

869
33:58.144 --> 33:58.945
It's so annoying.

870
34:06.705 --> 34:07.185
Hello?

871
34:10.584 --> 34:11.425
Say that again.

872
34:14.825 --> 34:16.624
Who demanded to postpone the meeting?

873
34:33.144 --> 34:34.544
You left your stuff here last time.

874
34:35.144 --> 34:35.825
Don't forget it.

875
34:39.104 --> 34:40.704
This is a gift for you.

876
34:42.945 --> 34:44.064
A good chair

877
34:44.704 --> 34:46.425
deserves a good match.

878
34:48.025 --> 34:48.985
You came all this way.

879
34:49.264 --> 34:49.945
Any update?

880
34:50.905 --> 34:51.584
Of course.

881
34:52.905 --> 34:53.985
Mr. Tian agreed

882
34:54.064 --> 34:55.104
to postpone the meeting.

883
34:55.345 --> 34:56.584
He definitely took my idea

884
34:56.624 --> 34:57.305
seriously.

885
34:57.785 --> 34:58.825
Still,

886
34:58.905 --> 34:59.945
I feel a little uneasy.

887
35:00.584 --> 35:01.505
Did I

888
35:01.544 --> 35:02.385
miss something?

889
35:02.584 --> 35:03.945
You shouldn't worry,

890
35:04.025 --> 35:04.825
but Di Liren should.

891
35:05.264 --> 35:06.025
The more he panics,

892
35:06.025 --> 35:07.104
the easier he'll mess up.

893
35:07.264 --> 35:08.144
Only then can we

894
35:08.305 --> 35:09.305
get leverage on him

895
35:09.425 --> 35:10.624
and sabotage his plans.

896
35:12.144 --> 35:13.425
No matter the situation,

897
35:14.264 --> 35:15.425
you always

898
35:16.144 --> 35:17.544
make things sound hopeful.

899
35:19.104 --> 35:20.224
Providing emotional support

900
35:20.224 --> 35:21.584
is part of my service.

901
35:22.704 --> 35:23.664
Oh, please.

902
35:26.473 --> 35:27.701
(Mom)

903
35:28.264 --> 35:28.785
It's my mom.

904
35:29.785 --> 35:30.425
What is it?

905
35:30.825 --> 35:31.744
Is your mom still

906
35:31.744 --> 35:32.624
doing spiritual stuff?

907
35:32.704 --> 35:33.624
Don't even bring it up.

908
35:33.744 --> 35:34.624
She watches

909
35:34.664 --> 35:35.345
relevant stuff.

910
35:35.425 --> 35:36.865
The algorithm even pushes it to me.

911
35:37.224 --> 35:37.865
I can barely

912
35:37.865 --> 35:38.744
see beauty feeds.

913
35:39.224 --> 35:39.985
Hello, Mom?

914
35:42.345 --> 35:42.865
What?

915
35:48.865 --> 35:50.704
Tian's wife recommended this place.

916
35:51.184 --> 35:52.425
She said their vegetarian food

917
35:52.505 --> 35:53.224
is amazing.

918
35:55.865 --> 35:56.345
Mom,

919
35:56.825 --> 35:58.505
hearing you're going up the mountain

920
35:58.584 --> 35:59.345
really scared me.

921
35:59.624 --> 36:01.224
I thought you were becoming a nun.

922
36:02.624 --> 36:03.184
By the way,

923
36:03.704 --> 36:05.544
why did you suddenly go vegetarian?

924
36:07.865 --> 36:09.025
It's good for our health.

925
36:14.425 --> 36:15.744
All right, I'm full.

926
36:16.064 --> 36:17.385
Forecast says it'll rain tonight.

927
36:17.505 --> 36:18.385
I need to head back

928
36:18.425 --> 36:19.345
before driving down

929
36:19.345 --> 36:20.064
becomes difficult.

930
36:20.985 --> 36:22.144
Wait a second. Come with me.

931
36:23.664 --> 36:24.104
Come.

932
36:26.465 --> 36:27.345
Since driving is hard,

933
36:27.345 --> 36:28.345
don't leave.

934
36:29.305 --> 36:30.544
Stay here with me.

935
36:31.624 --> 36:32.704
I can't, Mom.

936
36:32.985 --> 36:34.184
I have work to do.

937
36:34.305 --> 36:35.144
I have to get back.

938
36:36.465 --> 36:38.345
Mom, what are you doing?

939
36:38.465 --> 36:39.945
I brought your luggage.

940
36:40.345 --> 36:41.704
I signed you up for fasting.

941
36:42.144 --> 36:43.264
You have to stay with me

942
36:43.264 --> 36:44.385
for a whole week.

943
36:46.766 --> 36:49.505
(Three days ago)

944
36:49.505 --> 36:50.584
Where are you going?

945
36:51.385 --> 36:52.064
I have an errand.

946
36:52.345 --> 36:53.224
It's so late.

947
36:53.744 --> 36:54.744
Meng isn't back yet.

948
36:54.744 --> 36:56.224
Instead of picking her up,

949
36:56.945 --> 36:58.224
all you care about is yourself

950
36:58.345 --> 36:59.264
and your own stuff.

951
37:02.385 --> 37:02.825
Mom,

952
37:03.945 --> 37:04.905
I'm going to see Dad.

953
37:05.664 --> 37:06.224
I...

954
37:07.624 --> 37:08.945
I just had a strange dream,

955
37:09.305 --> 37:10.184
and it worried me.

956
37:10.544 --> 37:11.505
What did you dream?

957
37:12.584 --> 37:13.785
I dreamed Dad moved

958
37:14.144 --> 37:15.305
onto a mountain alone,

959
37:15.785 --> 37:16.264
living

960
37:16.345 --> 37:17.425
in a square house.

961
37:17.945 --> 37:18.785
The weird thing was,

962
37:19.385 --> 37:20.184
neighboring houses

963
37:20.224 --> 37:21.305
were totally identical.

964
37:22.505 --> 37:23.825
I said we'd visit him,

965
37:24.104 --> 37:24.865
but Dad rejected.

966
37:25.184 --> 37:25.945
He said we could

967
37:25.985 --> 37:27.025
visit him once a year.

968
37:27.385 --> 37:28.584
(Master Xiuyuan said)

969
37:29.305 --> 37:30.385
(our family)

970
37:30.744 --> 37:31.505
(would go)

971
37:31.505 --> 37:33.104
(to a scenic mountain.)

972
37:33.624 --> 37:35.224
(I really don't know)

973
37:35.345 --> 37:36.224
(if your dad will...)

974
37:37.104 --> 37:37.505
Mom,

975
37:37.865 --> 37:38.624
don't worry.

976
37:39.425 --> 37:40.505
I'm probably overthinking.

977
37:40.945 --> 37:41.584
I'll go see him.

978
37:42.624 --> 37:43.025
Okay.

979
37:45.425 --> 37:45.985
(Master,)

980
37:46.184 --> 37:48.184
(I understand what you meant now.)

981
37:48.465 --> 37:50.385
(Our family would visit a grave on the mountain.)

982
37:50.825 --> 37:52.025
(What should I do?)

983
37:52.465 --> 37:54.385
(I can't lose my husband.)

984
37:55.345 --> 37:56.025
Did it work?

985
37:58.544 --> 37:59.505
Lu Lizhen bought it.

986
38:00.465 --> 38:01.544
Thanks to you,

987
38:03.144 --> 38:03.785
our plan

988
38:03.825 --> 38:04.865
could work so quickly.

989
38:05.704 --> 38:06.945
Why did Mr. Tian suddenly

990
38:07.025 --> 38:08.104
postpone the meeting?

991
38:09.905 --> 38:11.425
Yu Meng is definitely behind this.

992
38:12.305 --> 38:13.624
As long as we brainwash her mom

993
38:13.905 --> 38:15.025
into focusing completely

994
38:15.064 --> 38:16.224
on Yu Jianguo,

995
38:16.985 --> 38:17.945
Yu Meng alone

996
38:18.385 --> 38:19.345
can't do anything.

997
38:19.905 --> 38:21.544
Aren't you afraid she'll get desperate

998
38:22.224 --> 38:23.544
and tell Lu Lizhen the truth?

999
38:26.385 --> 38:27.144
You've been

1000
38:27.264 --> 38:28.144
caring for Lu Lizhen.

1001
38:28.945 --> 38:29.945
Even if she finds out,

1002
38:30.264 --> 38:30.825
so what?

1003
38:31.905 --> 38:33.264
She has no strength or means.

1004
38:34.064 --> 38:34.664
Trust me.

1005
38:35.584 --> 38:36.305
Signing authority

1006
38:36.744 --> 38:37.905
will be ours soon.

1007
38:40.104 --> 38:40.945
By then...

1008
38:46.425 --> 38:47.905
We can finally leave,

1009
38:49.104 --> 38:49.945
together with Haoyu.

1010
38:52.104 --> 38:52.905
What is the Dao?

1011
38:53.253 --> 38:54.104
(15 days ago)

1012
38:54.104 --> 38:56.664
The Dao is the origin of the Chinese nation.

1013
38:57.744 --> 39:00.264
The foundation of Dao is primordial qi.

1014
39:00.264 --> 39:01.718
(Anti-Wrinkle and Anti-Aging)

1015
39:02.345 --> 39:03.345
It generates duality,

1016
39:03.785 --> 39:05.224
the two forces of yin and yang.

1017
39:05.704 --> 39:08.064
Duality generates the three realms,

1018
39:08.704 --> 39:11.624
representing Heaven, Earth, and Man.

1019
39:12.425 --> 39:13.025
Therefore,

1020
39:13.264 --> 39:15.385
the Dao produces one; one produces two;

1021
39:15.544 --> 39:17.704
two produces three; and three produces all things.

1022
39:18.144 --> 39:20.465
All things originate

1023
39:20.624 --> 39:22.544
from the primordial qi of the Dao.

1024
39:23.916 --> 39:28.864
(Four days ago)

1025
39:32.184 --> 39:33.224
Your finger?

1026
39:35.985 --> 39:36.825
Just a cut.

1027
39:39.905 --> 39:40.865
(How to pick locks with a hairpin) Master Xiuyuan said

1028
39:41.025 --> 39:42.144
fasting on the mountain,

1029
39:42.305 --> 39:43.104
not grave visiting,

1030
39:43.505 --> 39:45.264
would cure your dad.

1031
39:45.505 --> 39:46.345
Once he recovers,

1032
39:46.345 --> 39:47.505
everything will be fine.

1033
39:48.144 --> 39:49.865
Even if you convince Mr. Tian,

1034
39:50.104 --> 39:51.264
the other shareholders

1035
39:51.345 --> 39:52.064
might object.

1036
39:52.144 --> 39:53.144
Master also said

1037
39:53.264 --> 39:54.425
we must guard our minds

1038
39:54.785 --> 39:56.544
and make no reckless moves,

1039
39:56.744 --> 39:59.025
or it'll disrupt it all.

1040
40:00.505 --> 40:01.505
So you didn't

1041
40:01.505 --> 40:02.865
tell Mr. Tian any of that?

1042
40:03.785 --> 40:04.224
Mom,

1043
40:04.224 --> 40:05.264
why didn't you

1044
40:05.264 --> 40:06.104
do what I said?

1045
40:06.264 --> 40:07.624
Master told me to ignore you,

1046
40:07.825 --> 40:09.104
and never mention this

1047
40:09.104 --> 40:09.985
to Tian's wife.

1048
40:10.345 --> 40:12.184
Otherwise, your dad's condition will worsen.

1049
40:12.544 --> 40:13.305
Dad is sick,

1050
40:13.425 --> 40:14.425
and a doctor can help,

1051
40:14.505 --> 40:15.264
not some master.

1052
40:15.305 --> 40:16.425
Stop being so superstitious.

1053
40:16.704 --> 40:18.345
But the doctors haven't helped either.

1054
40:18.865 --> 40:20.305
I have to try something,

1055
40:20.425 --> 40:20.985
right?

1056
40:21.345 --> 40:23.945
Just treat it as an outing to unwind.

1057
40:24.104 --> 40:26.104
Stay with me for a few days, okay?

1058
40:27.385 --> 40:28.624
Sincerity brings blessings.

1059
40:29.425 --> 40:31.104
I believe a miracle will happen.

1060
40:31.664 --> 40:33.104
I really can't stay.

1061
40:33.144 --> 40:33.465
Mom,

1062
40:33.465 --> 40:34.505
open the door right now.

1063
40:34.505 --> 40:35.144
I have to attend

1064
40:35.144 --> 40:36.104
the shareholder meeting.

1065
40:36.224 --> 40:37.264
I have no time for this.

1066
40:37.345 --> 40:38.025
I know

1067
40:38.184 --> 40:39.785
you care about signing authority,

1068
40:40.064 --> 40:41.624
but is that really more important?

1069
40:42.104 --> 40:43.505
Why can't you try just once

1070
40:43.664 --> 40:44.704
for your dad?

1071
40:45.704 --> 40:46.264
Mom,

1072
40:46.825 --> 40:47.905
don't you get it?

1073
40:48.224 --> 40:49.465
Xiuyuan is a fraud!

1074
40:50.064 --> 40:51.465
He's not a fraud.

1075
40:51.624 --> 40:52.624
How could a fraud

1076
40:52.704 --> 40:53.905
be so accurate?

1077
40:54.224 --> 40:56.025
He knows so much about our family.

1078
40:56.305 --> 40:57.664
He got all my childhood stuff

1079
40:57.865 --> 40:59.184
perfectly right.

1080
40:59.345 --> 41:00.624
Spot on!

1081
41:02.825 --> 41:03.664
I can't believe this!

1082
41:14.664 --> 41:15.224
Mom!

1083
41:15.704 --> 41:16.144
Mom!

1084
41:16.144 --> 41:17.425
The candle fell on the rug!

1085
41:17.465 --> 41:18.305
It's on fire!

1086
41:18.865 --> 41:20.264
Open the door, Mom!

1087
41:20.264 --> 41:21.345
Let me out!

1088
41:25.544 --> 41:25.905
Mom!

1089
41:26.144 --> 41:27.264
Give it back to me!

1090
41:32.785 --> 41:33.305
Mom!

1091
41:34.144 --> 41:35.544
Have you completely lost your mind?

1092
41:38.236 --> 41:41.115
=The Vanishing Beauty= (Next Episode Preview)

1093
41:41.465 --> 41:42.385
Don't you think

1094
41:42.744 --> 41:43.544
Harry's background

1095
41:43.584 --> 41:44.624
sound familiar?

1096
41:44.905 --> 41:45.785
He's 20 years old

1097
41:45.905 --> 41:46.905
with a heart defect.

1098
41:46.905 --> 41:48.104
Lu Hui and Di Liren's child

1099
41:48.104 --> 41:49.064
was also born 20 years ago

1100
41:49.064 --> 41:50.028
with a heart defect.

1101
41:50.104 --> 41:51.064
What's more,

1102
41:51.264 --> 41:52.544
both had tetralogy of Fallot.

1103
41:53.305 --> 41:54.744
Mom, I'm back.

1104
41:55.345 --> 41:56.224
I heard

1105
41:56.744 --> 41:57.825
Harry call Lu Hui

1106
41:58.305 --> 41:58.785
Mom.

1107
41:59.264 --> 42:00.025
No need to come.

1108
42:00.425 --> 42:01.425
My friend helped me out.

1109
42:19.554 --> 42:22.986
♪We are broken butterflies♪

1110
42:23.263 --> 42:26.118
♪Can't fly beyond the boundary of fate♪

1111
42:26.487 --> 42:29.315
♪Wings torn apart by the night♪

1112
42:29.315 --> 42:33.130
♪Still seeking open fields in the ruins♪

1113
42:33.130 --> 42:34.771
♪Locked inside a pendulum♪

1114
42:34.771 --> 42:36.476
♪Repeating the same fate♪

1115
42:36.476 --> 42:37.904
♪I hear high heels♪

1116
42:37.904 --> 42:39.673
♪Crushing silent replies♪

1117
42:39.673 --> 42:41.314
♪Every step feels like a trial♪

1118
42:41.314 --> 42:42.806
♪Yet sobers me up♪

1119
42:42.806 --> 42:44.703
♪Love is a thorny rose♪

1120
42:44.703 --> 42:46.237
♪Promises are mere anesthesia♪

1121
42:46.237 --> 42:47.985
♪I once gave it my all♪

1122
42:47.985 --> 42:49.861
♪Only to be shattered in pieces♪

1123
42:50.052 --> 42:51.672
♪Now I forge my tears♪

1124
42:51.672 --> 42:53.313
♪Into gray diamond gems♪

1125
42:53.313 --> 42:55.125
♪No longer asking who's right or wrong♪

1126
42:55.125 --> 42:59.409
♪Only who dares to control me♪

1127
43:00.346 --> 43:02.051
♪I am nobody's accessory♪

1128
43:02.051 --> 43:03.607
♪Nor am I anyone's failure♪

1129
43:03.607 --> 43:05.056
♪Even with broken wings♪

1130
43:05.056 --> 43:06.484
♪I can still pierce the sky♪

1131
